  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/uppsc-staff-nurse-unani-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</a> </span>has released the answer key for the post of Staff Nurse Unani Examination 2025 on its official website. The application process for UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Recruitment 2025 were Accepted from 03 June 2025 to 03 July 2025. The written examination was held on 17 March 2026. Candidates are advised to check the complete details for UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key 2026 given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission (UPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPPSC Advt No : A-3/E-1/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>03 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>03 July 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>03 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date :&nbsp;<strong>10 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date&nbsp;:<b> 17 March 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card <b>: 09 March 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Answer Key <b>: 19 March 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 125/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: Rs. 65/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PH <strong>: Rs. 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 03 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Post Name</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b>Total Post</b></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">03</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPPSC UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidates must have passed Class 10 with Science and 10+2, along with a Diploma in Medical &amp; Surgical Nursing (Unani) and Midwifery (Unani), both registered with the Ayurvedic and Unani Tibbi Medicine Board, Uttar Pradesh. A valid registration certificate as a Unani Nurse and Midwife (Dhatri) is also required.</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to Login Page, Here they have to provide their following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Login ID/Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to download their UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Answer Key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their admit card from official site of the UPPSC.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPPSC UPPSC Staff Nurse Unani Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<